==English==

===Etymology===
Named by {{w|C. S. Lewis}} after the {{etyl|la|en}} name of the Italian town of {{w|Narni}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈnɑː(ɹ).ni.ə/|lang=en}}

===Proper noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{lb|en|fiction}} A land in which a series of seven children's books, ''[[w:The Chronicles of Narnia|The Chronicles of Narnia]]'' by [[w:C. S. Lewis|C. S. Lewis]] are set.

